        "summary": "The `common` package extends the sponsored-proposal funnel event vocabulary by adding `signup_opened` to `AGENTIC_FUNNEL_EVENT_TYPES` and `CLIENT_REPORTED_AGENTIC_FUNNEL_EVENT_TYPES`. This new stage tracks when a sponsored run opens the advertiser's tracked sign-up link in the desktop in-app browser, per COD-965. It is marked as telemetry only and distinguished from the advertiser-side `account_created` event to separate 'never opened' from 'opened, never signed up' in drop-off analysis. The event is not billable and not part of the repeating funnel events list.",
